      <h1>What Is BRC-20 on Bitcoin?</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">BRC-20 is an experimental inscription and indexer convention for deriving fungible balances from deploy, mint, and transfer operations recorded in Bitcoin transactions. Learn how JSON operations, ordering, two-step transfers, confirmations, reorganizations, parser compatibility, UTXO handling, and custody work without treating BRC-20 as a native Bitcoin token standard.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Digital Assets</li><li>Deep</li><li>Technical Analysis</li><li>16 to 19 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-23</li></ul>
